<view class="page feature-page treatment-page"><brand-header back="{{true}}" title="诊疗计划"></brand-header><view class="pad"><view class="feature-tabs"><button class="feature-tab {{tab === item ? 'active' : ''}}" wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="*this" data-tab="{{item}}" bindtap="changeTab">{{item}}</button></view><view class="panel treatment-card" wx:for="{{visible}}" wx:key="id"><button class="treatment-card-head" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="expand"><view><view class="section-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="card-note">{{item.doctor}} · {{item.clinic}}</view></view><text class="pill">{{item.status}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{expanded === item.id}}" class="treatment-card-detail"><view>{{item.description}}</view><view class="treatment-step" wx:for="{{item.steps}}" wx:for-item="step" wx:key="title"><view class="between"><text>{{step.title}}</text><text class="muted small">{{step.date}}</text></view><view class="card-note">{{step.status}}</view></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!visible.length}}" class="treatment-empty panel"><view class="personal-empty-icon"><ui-icon name="order" size="64"></ui-icon></view><view class="empty-title">暂无{{tab}}的诊疗计划</view><view class="card-note">面诊后，机构将为你同步个人诊疗安排</view><button class="primary-button personal-empty-action" bindtap="book">预约专业面诊</button></view><button class="panel personal-link" bindtap="appointments"><view><view>我的预约记录</view><view class="card-note">查看已保存的到院咨询安排</view></view><ui-icon name="chevron" size="27"></ui-icon></button><view class="notice">诊疗计划由机构确认后同步，当前尚未接入真实机构计划数据。</view></view></view>
